{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:37 2026-11-01 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"大埔御龍名門村屋580萬開拍\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d7ef64c0c44238b422a3fa92b5022f5/2026-11/202609014-_1_.png\"/>\n<p>大埔元嶺村御龍名門村屋，面積約1,400方呎，附連一個逾500方呎花園，屬業主盤，開拍價580萬元，較估價低約23%，呎價約4,143元。</p>\n<p>忠誠拍賣行發言人表示，大埔元嶺村御龍名門村屋地下及1樓單位，面積約1,400方呎，附連569方呎花園，屬業主盤，開拍價580萬元，較銀行估價的750萬元低170萬元或約23%，呎價約4,143元，將於本周三（4日）拍賣，同場共有約21項物業可供競投。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48ea4b8a78b6d19856f5561d95c51ff9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_12_46_26_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1e5dc79274fc4fc715a6e77f20d5ac0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_12_46_26_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b454c042cc4fbee967ceea072786523d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_12_46_26_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a301af43722eb6ab73142f8ee18b21c9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_12_46_27.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/220c0dcf529de83f7fd7b309c2b6afb6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_12_46_25.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3bdad22ce01e5576622e32284927cbe6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_12_46_25_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e6a6eab595deff58cf7971058c80697/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_12_46_26.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>較銀行估價低23%</h2>\n<p>該屋苑入口設有大閘，提供有系統和私隱度高的屋苑式管理，並鄰近大埔區大型豪宅康樂園，周邊環境清幽寧靜，空氣清新。</p>\n<p>屋苑普遍提供大面積單位，面積約1,400方呎或更大的複式間隔。部分單位附設私家花園及露台，廳區窗戶寬大開揚。</p>\n<p>該屋苑小學屬 84校網，中學大埔區，區內有多所知名中學，包括恩主教書院、迦密栢雨中學及王肇枝中學等。</p>\n<p>相關文章：</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T02:40:02.666122+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":399,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:15:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:18:19.057433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T02:38:18.161140+00:00","content_hash":"a9a31d9a01ad83a21b37d5ed273da4a6be6ed5df306afcc982042267b976f55d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}